From 931e38b3fe53a2c253dda348a426990b96e52e46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: proshiv85-byte <proshiv85@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:53:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] SystemUI: add a large condensed clock style for the AOD

On AOD, show a large condensed clock (Roboto Flex, narrowest width),
the date and a battery pill centered in the upper part of the screen,
with the notification icons centered below. A black scrim hides the
stock clock and smartspace while dozing. On wake the scrim fades out to
reveal the lockscreen while the large clock shrinks and moves to the
stock clock. Pulsing fades the style out so the stock pulse shows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Ica97a393a4728ebafec6c1d472362305e02fdef3
